  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Make the soundscape of one quiet place of your own: one bed, one mid layer, two or three details and a Reverb Zone. Use loops that join without a click, and balance them with Volume. Credit every sound you use (author, source and licence) in a Credits text file next to your scene.\r\n\r\n<b>Predict:</b> Before you build it: which of your sounds will be the loudest, and which will you barely notice?\r\n\r\n<b>Try:</b>\r\n1. <b>Collect:</b> a bed, a mid layer and two or three details, from Freesound (CC0 or CC-BY only, never Non-Commercial) or your own recordings. Write each one's credit as you download it.\r\n2. <b>Build:</b> one Audio Source per sound, with Loop and Play On Awake ticked, and a Reverb Zone that fits your place. Balance the Volumes.\r\n3. <b>Check:</b> listen in Play mode from your camera for one minute. Fix any click at a loop point and any layer that covers the others.\r\n\r\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: freesound.org (licence filter: CC0 or Attribution) \xB7 Asset Library, Sounds/Soundscape \xB7 the Credits tag beside this stand</color></size>"
