  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The bed is the air of a place: room tone, wind, distant traffic. It is quiet and never stops, so the space is never fully silent. It is one Audio Source with Loop and Play On Awake ticked, playing a clip that loops without a click: its end joins its start.\r\n\r\n<b>Predict:</b> \"Bed \xB7 Bad Cut\" plays the same kind of sound, but its clip was cut at a random point. What will you hear each time it loops?\r\n\r\n<b>Try:</b>\r\n1. Untick the Audio Source of \"Bed \xB7 Room Tone\" and tick the one of \"Bed \xB7 Bad Cut\". Listen for 30 seconds.\r\n2. Switch them back.\r\n3. Untick Loop on \"Bed \xB7 Room Tone\" and listen after its 20 seconds end.\r\n\r\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Asset Library, Sounds/Soundscape/Bed</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
